  },
  "question": {
    "text": "A proton moving with one tenth of velocity of light has a certain de Broglie wavelength of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi></math>. An alpha particle having certain kinetic energy has the same de-Brogle wavelength <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi></math>. The ratio of kinetic energy of proton and that of alpha particle is :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As we know, de Broglie&nbsp;wavelength&nbsp;is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mi>p</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Now kinetic energy can be written as,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence, required ratio</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>"
  }
}